<title>USA: St Joseph hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts $1.00 higher.</p>
<p>Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    57.50-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    56.00-57.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Limited sales, under 500 lbs steady; over 500 lbs</p>
<p>$1.00 higher. Top 52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	500-550 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>		550-700 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>Estimated Slaughter Hog Receipts:  500</p>
